# Deterministic line endings across platforms: every text file checks out as
# LF on every OS (Windows developers run `core.autocrlf=true` by default,
# which would otherwise silently rewrite working copies to CRLF and desync the
# SHA-256 source-provenance manifests and the Python/Bash gates). Binary
# assets are pinned explicitly so `text=auto` never guesses about them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
# TSV evidence tables carry a trailing empty `platform` column by schema;
# a tab before the newline is data, not trailing whitespace.
*.tsv whitespace=-trailing-space
